This file gathers and re-exports the run-eliminating map of Example 2.4: the basic constructions, the output equations for a leading zero, for two leading ones, and for one followed by zero, together with their cons forms, the relation of the run map on a cone, the cone-by-cone membership criterion, the input and output shift formulas, the fact that the run map satisfies its equations, the recursive agreement on principal elements, and the uniqueness theorem.
